{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276250/extras/0cfce325106b11ac4f5031507a0aa62f.avif?t=1758247068\" width=800 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a prelude to the <i>Mato</i> series storyline, <i>Mato Fragments </i>introduces the origin of Neo City, a stylish metropolis, populated by different cultures, timelines and technologies. However, a plot lurks in the scheming depths of the city that threatens to overthrow the fragile peace of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a growing plot that threatens the city looms on the horizon, you have to leverage gathered intelligence carefully and timely, and create a domino effect that will lead to the salvation of Neo City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276250/extras/0d5f087a6a3c2228972e11d00015e3ca.avif?t=1758247068\" width=800 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An expert in socializing and getting information, you can enter <i>Detective Mode</i> to observe characters to deduce their true intentions. Trade information wisely to impact their behavior and choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276250/extras/14fbead8849f0fe1f0fa34603cb30a5e.avif?t=1758247068\" width=800 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or rather, not at all. Trapped in a 5-day time loop, you have to tread carefully, as any wrong decision can set you back to the start of the loop. Study the diverse cast of characters as you collect information from them and help them avoid disastrous consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276250/extras/ad749942b4995e72180605cc8594fad4.avif?t=1758247068\" width=800 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Illustrated beautifully in a unique, stylized art style, Mato Fragments immerses players in a dark, retro-futuristic world that integrates both traditional and modern-day Asian influences in the art style, architecture, and character designs.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3276250?t=1758247068","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276250/fe6f0a431ed823111479e5e5441a57a54020a292/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758247068","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276250/21bbd33489a8cff8113840f8e9c644cc7fd9304a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758247068","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276250/21bbd33489a8cff8113840f8e9c644cc7fd9304a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758247068","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276250/extras/0cfce325106b11ac4f5031507a0aa62f.avif?t=1758247068\" width=800 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a prelude to the <i>Mato</i> series storyline, <i>Mato Fragments </i>introduces the origin of Neo City, a stylish metropolis, populated by different cultures, timelines and technologies. However, a plot lurks in the scheming depths of the city that threatens to overthrow the fragile peace of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a growing plot that threatens the city looms on the horizon, you have to leverage gathered intelligence carefully and timely, and create a domino effect that will lead to the salvation of Neo City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276250/extras/0d5f087a6a3c2228972e11d00015e3ca.avif?t=1758247068\" width=800 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An expert in socializing and getting information, you can enter <i>Detective Mode</i> to observe characters to deduce their true intentions. Trade information wisely to impact their behavior and choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276250/extras/14fbead8849f0fe1f0fa34603cb30a5e.avif?t=1758247068\" width=800 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or rather, not at all. Trapped in a 5-day time loop, you have to tread carefully, as any wrong decision can set you back to the start of the loop. Study the diverse cast of characters as you collect information from them and help them avoid disastrous consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276250/extras/ad749942b4995e72180605cc8594fad4.avif?t=1758247068\" width=800 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Illustrated beautifully in a unique, stylized art style, Mato Fragments immerses players in a dark, retro-futuristic world that integrates both traditional and modern-day Asian influences in the art style, architecture, and character designs.</p>","developers":["Arrowiz"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared