 photo shop owner moonlighting as an informant in the vibrant, but dangerous streets of Neo City. After harboring a strange fugitive, your skills as an informant are put to the test, as the fate of the entire city rests in your hands.","steam_appid":3276250,"support_info":{"email":"contact@arrowiz.com","url":"https://arrowiz.com"},"supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese","type":"game","website":"https://www.softsourcepublishing.com/release/mato-fragments/"}